pages['ac-repair.html']=service_page('Cooling service','AC Repair That Starts With a Clear Diagnosis','AC not cooling, blowing warm air, or making an unfamiliar sound? Request air-conditioning service across the Dallas–Fort Worth area.','AC Repair','ac-repair','What Is Your AC Doing?','Cooling problems can have many causes. A focused system evaluation helps identify what is happening before repair options are discussed.',['Blowing warm air','Weak airflow','System will not turn on','Frequent cycling','Unusual noises','Thermostat problems','Water around equipment','Higher energy usage'],[('Common Cooling Problems','Airflow restrictions, controls, electrical components, refrigerant circuits, drainage, and equipment condition can all affect cooling. A technician should evaluate the system rather than relying on one symptom alone.'),('Repair or Replacement?','A major repair is a good moment to compare cost, repair history, comfort, efficiency, and the condition of the overall system. Summit Comfort can organize those considerations without presenting one universal answer.')],'Schedule AC Repair')
pages['heating.html']=service_page('Heating service','Heating Repair for Furnaces &amp; Heat Pumps','No heat, uneven rooms, strange odors, or unusual equipment noise? Request practical heating service in the Dallas–Fort Worth area.','Heating Repair','heating','When Your Home Is Not Warming Up','Start with the symptoms you can safely observe. Do not open energized equipment or attempt repairs that should be handled by a qualified professional.',['No heat','Uneven temperatures','Furnace concerns','Heat pump concerns','Strange odors','Unusual noises','Short cycling','Thermostat issues'],[('Furnace and Heat Pump Support','Heating systems operate differently, so the right diagnostic path depends on the equipment in your home. Share the system type when you request service if you know it.'),('Safety Comes First','If you smell gas or suspect a carbon-monoxide concern, leave the property and contact the appropriate utility or emergency service. Do not use the website form for a safety emergency.')],'Schedule Heating Service')
pages['hvac-installation.html']=service_page('System replacement','HVAC Installation Planned Around Your Home','Compare heating and cooling replacement options based on comfort, equipment condition, efficiency goals, system sizing, and budget.','HVAC Installation','hvac-installation','When Replacement May Make Sense','There is no single age or repair threshold that fits every system. A useful replacement conversation considers the whole home and how the existing equipment is performing.',['Frequent repair needs','Persistent comfort problems','High operating costs','Uneven rooms','Humidity concerns','Changing home needs','Heat pump interest','Planned renovation'],[('Proper Sizing Matters','Equipment selection should consider the home, insulation, windows, duct system, occupancy, and climate—not just the capacity of the existing unit.'),('Compare the Right Options','A consultation can cover heat pumps, traditional split systems, efficiency levels, controls, warranties, and installation details relevant to the actual property.'),('Financing Options','Financing may be available for qualified customers through a client-approved provider. Replace this placeholder with verified provider disclosures, terms, and links before launch.')],'Request an Estimate')
pages['maintenance.html']=service_page('Seasonal system care','HVAC Maintenance Without the Guesswork','Plan seasonal inspections, performance checks, and reminders for your home’s heating and cooling equipment.','HVAC Maintenance','maintenance','A Practical Seasonal Routine','Maintenance is an opportunity to review condition, cleanliness, airflow, controls, and basic performance before peak cooling or heating demand.',['Equipment inspection','Filter considerations','Drainage checks','Electrical connections','Airflow review','Thermostat operation','Heating performance','Cooling performance'],[('What a Tune-Up Can Cover','The specific checklist should match the equipment, season, and client procedures. This demo intentionally avoids promising a universal checklist.'),('The Summit Comfort Plan','The membership section is structured for recurring-care benefits such as reminders, seasonal visits, priority scheduling, and discounts. Every benefit marked with an asterisk must be verified with the client.')],'Schedule a Tune-Up')
pages['indoor-air-quality.html']=service_page('Home comfort options','Indoor Air Quality Options for DFW Homes','Explore filtration, humidity, ventilation, duct, and control options without unsupported health claims.','Indoor Air Quality','indoor-air-quality','Start With the Home and the Concern','Indoor comfort can involve particles, humidity, stale air, odors, airflow, or controls. The right equipment depends on the source of the concern and the existing HVAC system.',['Air filtration','Humidity management','Ventilation options','Duct-related concerns','Airflow balance','Thermostat controls','Persistent odors','System compatibility'],[('Filtration and Airflow','Higher-efficiency filtration is not automatically appropriate for every system. Filter selection should consider equipment design and airflow requirements.'),('No Unsupported Health Promises','HVAC products may help manage certain indoor conditions, but this site does not claim to diagnose, treat, or prevent health conditions. Consult an appropriate professional for medical or environmental concerns.')],'Explore Air Quality Options')

about_body=page_hero('About Summit Comfort','Local Service Built Around Clear Communication','This fictional company story demonstrates how an HVAC contractor can present its people, philosophy, and local focus without inflated claims.','About Summit Comfort','Request Service')+f'''<section class="section"><div class="container split"><div class="media-panel"><img src="assets/images/hvac-technician-hero.jpg" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" alt="HVAC technician servicing an outdoor residential unit"><div class="media-badge">CUSTOMIZE: Replace with real owner or team photography.</div></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Our approach</p><h2>Make HVAC Service Easier to Understand</h2><p>At Summit Comfort, the goal is to give homeowners practical information, respectful service, and clear options. The strongest client version of this page should tell the real founder’s story in their own voice.</p><p>Use this space to explain why the company started, who it serves, what its team values, and how it participates in the local community.</p></div></div></section><section class="section section-soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Values</p><h2>What the Work Should Feel Like</h2></div></div><div class="feature-grid"><div class="feature"><h3>Clear</h3><p>Customers should understand the concern, the available options, and the next step.</p></div><div class="feature"><h3>Respectful</h3><p>Homes, schedules, and budgets deserve thoughtful treatment.</p></div><div class="feature"><h3>Practical</h3><p>Recommendations should connect to the property and the homeowner’s needs.</p></div><div class="feature"><h3>Local</h3><p>Service areas and availability should be represented accurately.</p></div><div class="feature"><h3>Professional</h3><p>Real team training, licenses, and credentials belong here once verified.</p></div><div class="feature"><h3>Accountable</h3><p>Follow-through and communication matter before, during, and after an appointment.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CUSTOMIZE: Team</p><h2>Put Real People at the Center</h2><p>Replace these structured placeholders with approved portraits, roles, short bios, and relevant credentials.</p></div></div><div class="reviews-grid"><article class="review-card"><span class="review-label">Owner photo placeholder</span><h3>Owner / Founder</h3><p>Add a real photograph and a concise introduction in the owner’s voice.</p></article><article class="review-card"><span class="review-label">Team photo placeholder</span><h3>Service Team</h3><p>Show the technicians customers may meet and describe real training.</p></article><article class="review-card"><span class="review-label">Local photo placeholder</span><h3>Community Connection</h3><p>Feature approved shop, fleet, or community imagery from the service area.</p></article></div></div></section>'''
pages['about.html']=page('About Summit Comfort Heating & Air | Dallas–Fort Worth', 'Learn about Summit Comfort’s clear, respectful approach to residential heating and cooling service across Dallas–Fort Worth.','about.html',about_body,'about')

area_body=page_hero('Dallas–Fort Worth service area','Local HVAC Service Across the Metroplex','Explore the demo service footprint, then call to confirm that your address and equipment fall within current availability.','Service Areas','Confirm Your Area','tel:+12145550147')+f'''<section class="section section-soft"><div class="container split"><div><p class="eyebrow">CUSTOMIZE: Actual service area</p><h2>Cities Represented in This Demo</h2><p>These locations are sample data for the fictional Summit Comfort brand. A client version should include only verified cities, neighborhoods, ZIP codes, and travel limitations.</p><div class="area-grid">{''.join(f'<div class="area-chip">{c}</div>' for c in ['Dallas','Fort Worth','Arlington','Plano','Irving','Garland','Frisco','McKinney','Richardson','Carrollton','Grapevine','Grand Prairie'])}</div><p>Don’t see your city? Call <a class="text-link" href="tel:+12145550147">(214) 555-0147</a> to confirm availability.</p></div>{sidebar('Need to confirm your ZIP code?')}</div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Local landing-page foundation</p><h2>Accurate Service Areas Build Trust</h2></div></div><div class="feature-grid"><div class="feature"><h3>Clear Boundaries</h3><p>List only locations the company can serve reliably.</p></div><div class="feature"><h3>Useful Local Detail</h3><p>Add verified neighborhood, ZIP, and property information where it helps customers.</p></div><div class="feature"><h3>Easy Confirmation</h3><p>Give edge-of-area customers a quick phone path to check availability.</p></div></div></div></section>'''
